---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact \u2013 GalexyKeyboard" description="Contact GalexyKeyboard: request a new language keyboard, report a layout issue, or ask a question.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl">Contact</h1>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
      <p>Missing a language? Found a key in the wrong place? We want to know. Layout correctness is the whole point of this tool.</p>
      <p>Open an issue on our project tracker, or email <a href="mailto:hello@galexykeyboard.example" class="text-brassdark underline">hello@galexykeyboard.example</a> (replace with your real address before launch).</p>
      <p>When reporting a layout issue, please include the language, the key you expected, and the key you got. A screenshot helps.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
